The legal text in this repository is the official text of the Constitución de la República Oriental del Uruguay,
as published by the Dirección Nacional de Impresiones y Publicaciones Oficiales (IMPO), Base de datos de
normativa (https://www.impo.com.uy/bases), and by the Parlamento del Uruguay (https://parlamento.gub.uy). Lexifina
makes no claim to it. Source of the text and of every date and reference: IMPO and the Parlamento del Uruguay.

This repository is not an official publication. Only the texts published by IMPO and the Parlamento are
authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, Lexifina has waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to this work.
